WEBVTT

00:09.260 --> 00:10.960
Wow.

00:11.260 --> 00:15.380
I haven't shown it to anyone else
besides my family.

00:15.660 --> 00:16.760
Sorry.

00:17.920 --> 00:19.520
This response

00:19.520 --> 00:20.860
feels like déjà vu.

00:21.220 --> 00:23.200
We should apologize
for forcing you into this.

00:23.200 --> 00:25.830
But ninjas are really cool.

00:27.380 --> 00:28.900
Although I am a ninja,

00:28.900 --> 00:32.400
I don't have as much talent as my brother.

00:32.800 --> 00:33.920
Even the techniques

00:34.180 --> 00:36.660
aren't really impressive.

00:37.360 --> 00:38.320
Rather,

00:38.320 --> 00:40.260
sometimes I wish
I didn't have these powers

00:40.920 --> 00:44.600
and were born as a 'normal' girl.

00:46.040 --> 00:48.700
I… I can understand how you feel.

00:49.040 --> 00:51.820
I also… want to be normal.

00:52.380 --> 00:55.720
I'm constantly thinking about
what 'normal' is for me.

00:57.940 --> 01:02.020
If I could discuss it with you,

01:02.020 --> 01:05.360
I would feel much more at ease.

01:07.100 --> 01:09.600
Okay… sure!

01:09.600 --> 01:10.760
And,

01:10.760 --> 01:13.200
I'm also very good at throwing things.

01:13.740 --> 01:15.680
I'd really like to see that.

01:15.680 --> 01:18.820
What a beautiful scene.

01:18.820 --> 01:20.780
Hey…

01:21.100 --> 01:26.340
It seems like you're one step
closer to your harem dream.

01:26.340 --> 01:27.100
Eh?

01:27.100 --> 01:30.380
Several cute girls around you.

01:30.380 --> 01:32.300
You can take your pick.

01:32.600 --> 01:35.420
It's not like that!

01:35.640 --> 01:38.160
That's not the case at all.

01:41.950 --> 01:48.330
(You Are Ms. Servant.)

03:11.120 --> 03:11.580
I didn't see you during the cultural festival.

03:11.580 --> 03:13.040
(Episode 10: You and the Forbidden Fruit)
I didn't see you during the cultural festival.

03:13.040 --> 03:14.660
(Episode 10: You and the Forbidden Fruit)
Why did you suddenly appear?

03:14.660 --> 03:14.790
(Episode 10: You and the Forbidden Fruit)
Beautiful women are all mysterious.

03:14.790 --> 03:17.080
Beautiful women are all mysterious.

03:17.080 --> 03:18.760
Ms. Nitta?

03:18.760 --> 03:22.780
Ah, this doesn't satisfy you?

03:22.780 --> 03:24.380
Okay, you can touch if you want.

03:30.540 --> 03:33.140
I was planning to throw it at that tree.

03:33.140 --> 03:35.460
Don't unconsciously go for someone's life.

03:35.460 --> 03:37.340
Are you a mechanical doll?

03:37.340 --> 03:38.540
Don't mind it.

03:38.540 --> 03:43.340
Don't forget your place;
you asked me to investigate your sister.

03:43.340 --> 03:44.640
Master Hitoyoshi.

03:44.640 --> 03:46.980
I'm sorry for having startled you.

03:46.980 --> 03:48.860
It's okay, I'm fine.

03:48.860 --> 03:52.620
She acts without malice,
so of course she won't reflect.

03:52.940 --> 03:54.180
Darn it.

03:54.380 --> 03:59.660
So, Ms. Nitta is not
a 'normal' person either?

04:01.160 --> 04:02.960
I am from the Hikage…

04:02.960 --> 04:05.500
Yeah, the youngest daughter
of the Hikage family, right?

04:06.700 --> 04:08.500
You… you know me?

04:08.780 --> 04:11.300
I rely on intelligence for a living.

04:13.000 --> 04:14.360
Moreover,

04:16.340 --> 04:20.740
I also know you wrote
the name on Yuki's test paper.

04:20.740 --> 04:22.240
Eh…

04:25.500 --> 04:27.280
Put away your murderous aura.

04:30.240 --> 04:32.960
She has more people to protect now.

04:34.420 --> 04:37.320
Miss Grace, what brings you here?

04:37.320 --> 04:38.700
Oh, I almost forgot.

04:38.960 --> 04:41.760
I'm going to China for a mission.

04:42.160 --> 04:44.220
If I meet some of her old acquaintances,

04:44.220 --> 04:46.600
I might be able to get
some information about your sister.

04:47.060 --> 04:49.920
It's too risky to inquire directly
with the organization.

04:50.540 --> 04:53.040
That place is your old haunt, isn't it?

04:53.720 --> 04:54.400
No.

04:54.860 --> 04:58.040
Besides my master,
I don't know anyone there.

04:58.340 --> 04:59.480
Oh.

04:59.800 --> 05:01.540
Well, I just came to say this.

05:01.820 --> 05:04.960
It's a shame I can't
spend Christmas with you.

05:05.220 --> 05:09.410
Spend a good 'six hours of intimacy'
with Hitoyoshi.

05:10.640 --> 05:11.540
Intimacy?

05:11.540 --> 05:13.790
Don't feed them that nonsense.

05:15.160 --> 05:17.640
Old haunt.

05:21.780 --> 05:22.700
Um…

05:22.700 --> 05:25.220
Yuki and Yokoya,

05:25.540 --> 05:27.700
are you two dating?

05:27.700 --> 05:28.580
Eh?

05:29.680 --> 05:33.800
This is my first time talking
about romance with someone.

05:33.800 --> 05:37.220
If I shouldn't bring this up right now,
I'm very sorry.

05:37.220 --> 05:38.840
After all, you are cousins.

05:38.840 --> 05:39.780
No, that's not it.

05:39.780 --> 05:42.100
I just said, it's not like that.

05:42.100 --> 05:43.100
Eh?

05:43.100 --> 05:44.560
It's not?

05:44.560 --> 05:47.320
I'm sorry!

05:47.320 --> 05:48.260
Wow.

05:48.260 --> 05:50.320
I should be the one to apologize.

05:50.320 --> 05:54.160
Because I've always thought
you two make a good match…

05:54.740 --> 05:56.660
We are not.

05:56.660 --> 05:59.200
And your premise is completely wrong.

05:59.200 --> 06:00.700
Miss Yuki and I are…

06:00.700 --> 06:01.160
Right?

06:05.840 --> 06:06.940
Miss Yuki?

06:08.240 --> 06:12.580
Mentioning old acquaintances reminded me…

06:15.120 --> 06:21.620
that I have never been cared for by others,
nor have I ever missed anyone…

06:23.220 --> 06:25.140
All I needed was to take care of myself.

06:25.700 --> 06:27.220
But now…

06:28.700 --> 06:30.760
I have more people I want to protect.

06:31.360 --> 06:32.600
It makes me very happy.

06:36.220 --> 06:37.440
Yes.

06:38.000 --> 06:39.940
Her feelings

06:39.940 --> 06:42.180
must be that kind of love
among family members.

06:44.640 --> 06:45.900
It's snowing.

06:55.930 --> 06:58.890
I WILL RETURN TO MY COUNTRY
DURING THE NEW YEAR. FROM DAD.

07:10.020 --> 07:11.580
Wow.

07:14.680 --> 07:15.620
I understand.

07:15.620 --> 07:18.420
Snowing does excite people, right?

07:21.060 --> 07:22.720
It's Yuki Mochi.

07:24.020 --> 07:25.140
Then I'll join in.

07:28.980 --> 07:30.520
Done, mini snowman.

07:31.320 --> 07:33.800
It doesn't snow much here.

07:34.080 --> 07:37.900
So when I was a kid,
I used to make these tiny snowmen.

07:38.240 --> 07:40.140
I'll join too…

07:48.400 --> 07:50.620
Mine's a bit deformed.

07:51.020 --> 07:53.120
No, it's very much your style.

07:53.600 --> 07:55.080
How should I put it…

07:55.560 --> 07:58.840
This effort to make oneself smooth

07:58.840 --> 08:00.700
is very much like you.

08:01.800 --> 08:03.500
Master Hitoyoshi.

08:13.860 --> 08:15.200
Eh?

08:15.200 --> 08:16.180
Oh!

08:17.560 --> 08:19.040
Agemochitarou.

08:21.260 --> 08:23.300
I… I've been…

08:23.740 --> 08:27.160
You've been naughty lately, Mochitaro.

08:27.360 --> 08:31.660
I… I need to restore it
to its original shape.

08:33.240 --> 08:35.960
You might as well give up, Miss Yuki.

08:45.500 --> 08:47.840
Sorry, I'm going to take a call.

08:48.540 --> 08:49.700
Yes.

08:50.740 --> 08:52.700
Hmm.

08:52.700 --> 08:54.120
I see.

08:54.700 --> 08:55.800
No, that's…

08:56.980 --> 08:58.900
Hmm… I understand.

08:59.660 --> 09:02.240
I will talk about it with mom and Riko.

09:03.840 --> 09:04.680
That's it.

09:06.620 --> 09:08.580
Has it come to this time already?

09:11.440 --> 09:12.580
Sorry, Miss Yuki.

09:13.040 --> 09:15.640
I'm going to Riko's place.
Could you please watch the house?

09:16.100 --> 09:17.620
I understand.

09:19.260 --> 09:21.300
Um… Master Hitoyoshi.

09:30.060 --> 09:32.160
It's so cold.

09:32.560 --> 09:35.180
She said she wanted to
meet on the way back.

09:35.180 --> 09:37.220
Does she want to eat outside?

09:37.480 --> 09:40.040
Today is Christmas;
there will be a lot of people.

09:41.580 --> 09:43.200
What are they looking at?

09:50.780 --> 09:51.840
Master Hitoyoshi.

09:55.480 --> 09:57.700
Why are you dressed like that?

09:57.880 --> 10:00.040
Although it is normal attire.

10:01.100 --> 10:03.640
I thought you must feel cold
on your way here.

10:03.640 --> 10:05.940
So, I warmed the scarf up in advance.

10:06.560 --> 10:08.040
Are you a Sengoku warlord?

10:08.380 --> 10:11.600
But doing this on Christmas…

10:11.600 --> 10:12.820
It's just like…

10:13.580 --> 10:14.340
Yes.

10:16.260 --> 10:17.280
Let's date,

10:17.740 --> 10:18.920
you and I.

10:19.260 --> 10:21.180
Date?

10:21.800 --> 10:23.020
Date?

10:23.220 --> 10:24.520
Why again…

10:24.520 --> 10:25.480
Huh?

10:25.480 --> 10:27.780
Miss Riko said by dating you,

10:27.780 --> 10:30.000
it could boost your spirits.

10:30.800 --> 10:33.240
When you were out,
I received a phone call…

10:34.560 --> 10:38.240
She said you seemed preoccupied lately.

10:39.920 --> 10:41.900
And before, you seemed

10:42.460 --> 10:44.380
to be in low spirits too.

10:45.460 --> 10:52.080
So I hope to be of some help.

10:54.040 --> 10:56.920
If you are feeling down,

10:56.920 --> 11:00.720
I won't be able to become a round snowman.

11:14.000 --> 11:15.400
Miss Yuki.

11:17.040 --> 11:20.580
If that's the case,

11:25.480 --> 11:26.600
then

11:27.000 --> 11:27.820
let's date.

11:28.440 --> 11:29.500
Okay.

11:29.740 --> 11:30.720
No problem.

11:31.040 --> 11:32.380
Should we keep holding hands?

11:32.674 --> 11:33.574
Yes.

11:33.920 --> 11:36.340
Miss Riko said I must
not let go of your hands.

11:38.120 --> 11:39.400
Ah.

11:40.320 --> 11:42.800
I can already guess Riko's expression.

11:43.240 --> 11:45.379
Though it's out of necessity,

11:45.380 --> 11:49.960
I still resist seeing
Miss Yuki in that way.

11:50.440 --> 11:52.460
To me, Miss Yuki

11:53.160 --> 11:54.560
is an adult on the outside,

11:54.560 --> 11:56.020
but has the heart of a baby.

11:56.020 --> 11:56.520
RAISED WITH SAUCE
but has the heart of a baby.

11:56.520 --> 11:56.980
HEALTHY CHILD
but has the heart of a baby.

11:56.980 --> 11:57.220
DO NOT IMITATE
but has the heart of a baby.

11:57.220 --> 11:57.980
DO NOT IMITATE
Pfft.

11:59.340 --> 12:02.280
If I were to harbor such feelings,

12:03.080 --> 12:05.000
then our relationship…

12:05.520 --> 12:08.413
Where shall we go, Master Hitoyoshi?

12:08.414 --> 12:09.934
Huh?

12:11.040 --> 12:12.720
Anyway, let's go eat.

12:13.340 --> 12:14.220
Ah.

12:14.220 --> 12:15.200
Snow?

12:15.200 --> 12:16.560
It's started to snow again.

12:17.060 --> 12:19.700
Are you cold, Master Hitoyoshi?

12:20.040 --> 12:21.080
I'm okay.

12:21.440 --> 12:22.840
I have a scarf.

12:23.220 --> 12:24.700
Ah, look.

12:26.220 --> 12:28.420
The snowflakes are fluttering
among the neon lights.

12:28.640 --> 12:31.700
The snowflakes diffuse the light,
making it even brighter.

12:32.800 --> 12:35.400
I really enjoy this scene.

12:36.409 --> 12:40.069
This is one of the reasons
why I like snow.

12:43.000 --> 12:43.500
Eh?

12:43.760 --> 12:45.280
Did I say something strange?

12:45.580 --> 12:46.600
No…

12:49.500 --> 12:53.820
Hearing you say you like snow
makes me very happy.

13:08.520 --> 13:11.220
Although I'm well aware that
you're not talking about me,

13:11.500 --> 13:14.260
somehow it just makes me very happy.

13:17.860 --> 13:18.820
Eh?

13:22.320 --> 13:23.460
Eh?

13:28.080 --> 13:28.950
Choose your Christmas date outfit

13:28.950 --> 13:30.410
A FEW HOURS AGO
Choose your Christmas date outfit

13:30.410 --> 13:30.520
RIKO
Choose your Christmas date outfit

13:30.520 --> 13:32.580
RIKO
before my brother comes to my place.

13:32.580 --> 13:33.740
RIKO
I remember you have

13:33.740 --> 13:35.330
RIKO
a loose knit sweater, right?

13:35.520 --> 13:37.240
You have a great figure.

13:37.240 --> 13:40.580
With something that shows off your curves,
you'll look very stylish.

13:40.580 --> 13:42.640
But since it's for Christmas,
let's go with the sweet look.

13:42.640 --> 13:45.440
You can wear a tighter skirt below.

13:45.440 --> 13:47.790
For the inner layer, wear a camisole
that can go with the knit sweater.

13:48.320 --> 13:49.540
Loose.

13:49.540 --> 13:50.820
Sweet.

13:50.820 --> 13:51.960
Tight.

13:52.180 --> 13:53.280
Camisole.

13:53.600 --> 13:56.180
The neck area lacks something.

13:56.540 --> 13:57.620
Neck…

13:57.980 --> 13:59.780
I already have a bell around my neck.

13:59.780 --> 14:01.200
Ah, indeed.

14:01.200 --> 14:02.840
A choker would be nice.

14:03.460 --> 14:05.110
RIKO
Let your hair down

14:05.110 --> 14:05.720
and secure it with a clip.

14:06.080 --> 14:07.600
You bought a handbag too, right?

14:07.600 --> 14:08.880
Take that with you.

14:09.800 --> 14:11.399
This?

14:11.400 --> 14:14.340
For the legs, how about
stockings with ankle boots?

14:14.620 --> 14:18.380
This outfit will bring back
Master Hitoyoshi's spirit?

14:18.380 --> 14:20.340
Yes, it will.

14:20.340 --> 14:21.960
DAD'S HOME
It's Christmas.

14:22.420 --> 14:24.740
That inherently comes with its own magic.

14:25.260 --> 14:28.200
Let my brother see
a different, beautiful Miss Yuki.

14:28.200 --> 14:30.580
Give him a surprise.

14:31.100 --> 14:32.300
Surprise.

14:34.300 --> 14:35.060
Okay.

14:35.380 --> 14:39.820
I'll do my best to dress up
even prettier than the real 'snow'.

14:42.040 --> 14:45.580
That's it. I really want you to hear that.

14:45.580 --> 14:48.480
Miss Snow is just too cute.

14:49.000 --> 14:50.820
Ah, is that so?

14:51.260 --> 14:53.600
I really don't want to hear this now.

14:54.580 --> 14:56.080
By the way,

14:56.080 --> 14:58.280
Riko, do you think Miss Yuki

14:58.740 --> 15:01.420
can have romantic feelings?

15:01.800 --> 15:04.820
I really can't imagine it.

15:04.820 --> 15:05.960
However,

15:05.960 --> 15:09.240
if my fondness for you is thirty,

15:09.240 --> 15:11.360
Miss Yuki probably has over a thousand.

15:11.640 --> 15:13.680
Your fondness for me is too low.

15:13.680 --> 15:14.840
So,

15:14.840 --> 15:16.840
I think she just hasn't noticed

15:17.060 --> 15:18.800
her own romantic feelings.

15:19.920 --> 15:22.340
As long as there is a desire
to be with the opposite sex,

15:22.340 --> 15:24.400
then that's love.

15:24.660 --> 15:25.700
Ugh…

15:27.517 --> 15:29.617
Just wanting to be together

15:29.960 --> 15:31.660
makes it love?

15:32.000 --> 15:33.920
Since you care so much about it…

15:34.600 --> 15:35.600
UNREQUITED LOVE TEST
Here.

15:35.600 --> 15:37.290
HOW MUCH DOES THE ONE YOU LIKE CARE ABOUT YOU?
This is an unrequited love test.

15:37.720 --> 15:38.640
Ha?

15:38.640 --> 15:42.700
Simply put, this can measure how much
the other person cares about you.

15:42.700 --> 15:44.760
Who believes that kind of test?

15:45.040 --> 15:47.600
No, this is quite accurate.

15:47.600 --> 15:50.360
My friend confessed
after getting a positive result,

15:50.720 --> 15:53.240
and it turned out very successfully.

15:53.480 --> 15:54.980
That must have been a coincidence.

15:54.980 --> 15:57.940
Come on, taking the test won't hurt.

15:58.560 --> 16:00.240
Then let's start. Question one.

16:00.480 --> 16:02.860
Does the other person
have physical contact with you?

16:03.220 --> 16:04.520
Hmm…

16:04.520 --> 16:05.740
Hands, I guess.

16:05.740 --> 16:06.480
Yes.

16:06.740 --> 16:08.000
UNREQUITED LOVE TEST
Question two.

16:08.000 --> 16:09.440
HOW MUCH DOES THE ONE YOU LIKE CARE ABOUT YOU?
Does the person often compliment you?

16:09.440 --> 16:10.000
Does the person often compliment you?

16:10.000 --> 16:11.140
Yes.

16:11.140 --> 16:12.280
Question three.

16:12.280 --> 16:14.960
Does the person actively chat with you?

16:14.960 --> 16:15.980
Yes.

16:16.240 --> 16:17.760
After all, we live together.

16:17.760 --> 16:18.940
Question four.

16:18.940 --> 16:21.620
Will the person help you
when you're in trouble?

16:21.620 --> 16:23.320
Yes…

16:23.320 --> 16:24.240
Question five.

16:24.240 --> 16:26.220
Do you often catch
each other's eyes unintentionally?

16:26.840 --> 16:27.960
Yes.

16:28.200 --> 16:29.440
Question six.

16:29.440 --> 16:32.120
Does the person often smile
when talking to you?

16:33.760 --> 16:34.880
Yes.

16:36.480 --> 16:37.640
The last question.

16:37.960 --> 16:39.260
Question twenty-five.

16:39.480 --> 16:42.480
Aside from confessions,
has the person ever said 'I like you' to you?

16:43.760 --> 16:47.310
Hearing Master Hitoyoshi say
you like me made me really happy…

16:51.200 --> 16:53.900
N… No.

16:54.360 --> 16:56.260
Alright, the results are out.

16:57.060 --> 17:00.180
THE CHANCE FOR YOU TWO TO DATE
There's a 96 percent chance of mutual affection.

17:00.180 --> 17:01.110
96 PERCENT

17:02.980 --> 17:05.220
Now you have to do it.

17:05.221 --> 17:07.641
96 percent, you're basically a couple!

17:07.917 --> 17:10.097
You say it so casually…

17:10.820 --> 17:13.920
It's the remaining 4 percent
that I'm fearing.

17:15.420 --> 17:17.400
I'm back.

17:18.180 --> 17:19.440
Welcome home.

17:20.560 --> 17:23.160
Thanks for doing the shopping
and walking the dog.

17:23.440 --> 17:24.240
No problem.

17:27.680 --> 17:28.380
Ah.

17:28.380 --> 17:30.280
You bought the radish this time?

17:30.700 --> 17:31.820
Yes.

17:31.820 --> 17:34.200
I won't mix it up
with the squid ever again.

17:34.960 --> 17:36.980
Radish and squid?

17:42.980 --> 17:45.840
If it's just normal conversation,

17:45.840 --> 17:48.220
I can communicate with her normally.

17:49.020 --> 17:51.220
So just like what Riko said,

17:51.700 --> 17:54.360
it was the magic of Christmas then?

17:54.780 --> 17:55.780
Right.

17:55.780 --> 17:59.120
Miss Yuki, I'm going to ask you
a few questions, just answer with yes or no.

17:59.120 --> 18:00.560
No, wait…

18:00.560 --> 18:01.540
Question one.

18:01.540 --> 18:04.380
Does my brother have
physical contact with you?

18:04.380 --> 18:05.180
Yes.

18:05.180 --> 18:07.060
The first question
already embarrasses me…

18:07.360 --> 18:08.500
Question two.

18:08.500 --> 18:10.560
Does my brother often compliment you?

18:10.560 --> 18:11.240
Yes.

18:11.240 --> 18:12.240
Ugh…

18:12.780 --> 18:13.760
Question three.

18:13.760 --> 18:16.680
Does my brother actively chat with you?

18:17.140 --> 18:17.920
Yes.

18:19.600 --> 18:20.820
Question four.

18:20.820 --> 18:24.520
Will my brother help you
if you're in trouble?

18:24.780 --> 18:25.800
Yes.

18:29.710 --> 18:33.130
RIKO

18:33.340 --> 18:34.360
The last question.

18:34.360 --> 18:35.640
Question twenty-five.

18:35.640 --> 18:39.500
Apart from confessing,
did my brother ever say 'I like you' to you?

18:39.760 --> 18:40.620
Yes.

18:40.940 --> 18:44.180
He said he liked 'snow' during Christmas.

18:44.180 --> 18:45.060
Huh?

18:45.060 --> 18:46.420
Miss Yuki!

18:46.940 --> 18:49.960
196 percent of mutual affection.

18:50.860 --> 18:55.006
My whole life, without regrets.

18:55.006 --> 18:57.160
Don't set off with a misunderstanding.

19:03.660 --> 19:06.200
Miss Yuki, this thing called a kotatsu,

19:06.200 --> 19:09.100
the best way to use it is to
stretch your feet straight in.

19:09.540 --> 19:10.960
Stretch my feet?

19:12.400 --> 19:13.720
Like this?

19:13.720 --> 19:14.960
Exactly.

19:16.180 --> 19:17.540
Your legs are so long.

19:17.980 --> 19:21.780
Kotatsu… is really warm
and makes me happy.

19:21.780 --> 19:22.880
Yeah.

19:22.880 --> 19:24.440
I like it very much too.

19:24.440 --> 19:26.180
Because we don't have a Kotatsu at home,

19:26.180 --> 19:28.820
we haven't gathered around
to have hot pot like this for ages.

19:29.540 --> 19:31.240
It's all thanks to you.

19:33.520 --> 19:36.460
There was never enough space
for a Kotatsu at home before.

19:36.460 --> 19:40.600
My brother used to make
a mess at home to upset dad.

19:40.940 --> 19:42.160
Upset him?

19:42.600 --> 19:44.780
You… don't be a blabbermouth.

19:45.480 --> 19:47.480
Did I say something strange?

19:47.740 --> 19:48.620
No…

19:50.280 --> 19:54.700
I don't want her to know
I was a childish brat.

19:55.280 --> 19:57.160
I really can't bring myself to say it…

19:57.480 --> 20:01.500
You just don't want her to know
about your childish side, right?

20:01.500 --> 20:02.560
Riko!

20:03.580 --> 20:08.000
She makes cold remarks
when I'm upset over it…

20:08.000 --> 20:10.660
Because he wants to
show you his cool side.

20:15.320 --> 20:18.140
She made me even more conscious
of my relationship with Miss Yuki.

20:21.160 --> 20:24.200
Now I must invoke
divine punishment on you.

20:24.680 --> 20:25.680
And then,

20:25.680 --> 20:27.900
I spat out my milk.

20:27.900 --> 20:28.931
-Take that!
-Tsujioka next to me lent me a rag.

20:28.932 --> 20:31.220
Tsujioka next to me lent me a rag.

20:31.220 --> 20:31.697
-Eh?
-I scrubbed the table hard.

20:31.698 --> 20:34.560
I scrubbed the table hard.

20:34.560 --> 20:37.080
Then the kneaded erasers merged into one.

20:37.080 --> 20:39.180
-Ah, although it's a kneaded eraser,
-No reaction at all.

20:39.180 --> 20:40.660
it's not an ordinary kneaded eraser.

20:40.660 --> 20:42.400
It's one that the whole class made

20:42.400 --> 20:45.620
from a collection
of lots of eraser scraps.

20:45.620 --> 20:46.880
And there are three of them.

20:46.880 --> 20:50.300
We named them 'Absolute' 'Non' and 'Sense,'
and cared for them.

20:50.300 --> 20:53.540
Now these three have become one.

20:53.540 --> 20:57.680
The whole class is arguing
over who should own it.

21:04.460 --> 21:05.240
Eh?

21:05.240 --> 21:06.080
What?

21:06.080 --> 21:07.560
What's with you two?

21:07.960 --> 21:09.040
No…

21:09.260 --> 21:10.420
Um…

21:10.660 --> 21:12.220
Ah…

21:12.220 --> 21:13.600
I'm truly sorry!

21:14.580 --> 21:15.580
It's okay…

21:15.920 --> 21:17.040
What's up?

21:17.040 --> 21:18.960
Is it a secret just between you?

21:19.940 --> 21:21.980
Is it a signal of love?
